    401  4095							; ADVANCED SOUND values (the menu's choices index these). SID vibrato depth
    402  4095							; x 1/4096 of the frequency (61 = 1/4 semitone), rate x 1/262 Hz, delay in
    403  4095							; 4 ms; glide 1/2^k of the way per 4 ms; tremolo depth of 15, rate x 1/655
    404  4095							; Hz; SID detune (8 = FAT's, about 7 cents); Game Boy warble.
    405  4095		       1e 3d 5b 7a uVibDepT   .byte.b	30, 61, 91, 122
    406  4099		       0c 12 18 1e*uVibRateLo .byte.b	<524, <786, <1048, <1310, <1572, <1834, <2096
