     10  7a78							;  row 13     SPACE's action, octave (the lowest key), transpose
     11  7a78							;  row 14     v0.40: the effect the C= keys work on, its setting
     12  7a78							;  row 15     held notes
     13  7a78							;  row 16     MIDI in
     14  7a78							;  row 24     F keys
